      "id": 406545,
      "username": "gopikrishnan",
      "name": "GOPIKRISHNAN",
      "created_at": "2024-05-01T02:54:44.696Z",
      "cooked": "<p>If you don’t need any data in the system, start by deleting all transactions. To do this, go to the Company list, open the company, click on “Manage,” then select “Delete Transactions.”<br>\n<div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/2/3/23e5ef431872ab274ce544beadfb03861d085f32.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/23e5ef431872ab274ce544beadfb03861d085f32\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/2/3/23e5ef431872ab274ce544beadfb03861d085f32_2_690x220.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"57zlkLtKNmGQngsoI5VE8o16Wie\" width=\"690\" height=\"220\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/2/3/23e5ef431872ab274ce544beadfb03861d085f32_2_690x220.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/2/3/23e5ef431872ab274ce544beadfb03861d085f32.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/2/3/23e5ef431872ab274ce544beadfb03861d085f32.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"F7F7F7\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">771×246 12 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>Enter your password and company name to confirm. This action will clear all transaction history. Afterward, you can change the stock valuation method as needed in the stock settings.</p>",
